---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="关于机场狗：致力于透明、客观的机场评测 | 机场狗"
  description="了解机场狗（JiChangDog）的创立初衷、核心价值观以及我们如何为您提供真实、可靠的翻墙机场评测数据。"
>
  <article class="page-shell knowledge-layout">
    <div class="article-content prose">
      <div class="document-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">关于我们</p>
        <h1>关于机场狗 (JiChangDog)</h1>
        <p class="lead-paragraph">我们致力于将极其复杂的翻墙网络与机场节点信息，整理成真正能让小白看懂、极客也能获益的硬核评测基准。</p>
      </div>

      <h2 id="section-1">我们的初衷</h2>
      <p>在寻找稳定可靠的科学上网服务（俗称“机场”）时，很多用户面临着信息不对称、虚假宣传和频繁跑路的问题。<strong>机场狗</strong>的创立就是为了打破这一现状，通过实际购买、持续监测和多维度评测，为大家提供一个透明、客观的数据参考平台。</p>

      <h2 id="section-2">核心价值观</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>客观真实：</strong> 我们的所有评测数据均来源于真实的宽带环境测试，不捏造数据，不接受买榜。</li>
        <li><strong>独立评测：</strong> 我们保持中立，所有文章与测速报告均由独立编辑团队完成。</li>
        <li><strong>持续更新：</strong> 翻墙环境瞬息万变，我们会定期进行复测并更新评测报告，确保信息的时效性。</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="section-3">我们提供什么？</h2>
      <p>我们提供包括但不限于以下内容：</p>
      <ul>
        <li>深度的机场评测报告与长期跟踪。</li>
        <li>真实网络环境下的节点测速（Speedtest）与流媒体解锁测试。</li>
        <li>翻墙客户端（如 Clash、v2rayN）的使用教程与技巧。</li>
        <li>防止被坑的机场避坑指南与跑路预警。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <aside class="toc-sidebar">
      <div class="toc-container">
        <h3 class="toc-title">本文目录</h3>
        <ul id="toc-list" class="toc-list">
          <!-- JS will populate this -->
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .knowledge-layout {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    gap: 40px;
    padding-top: 80px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .article-content {
    flex: 1 1 0%;
    min-width: 0;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }
  
  .document-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .document-header .eyebrow {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .document-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  
  .prose .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #374151;
    background: #f0fdf4;
    border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #eff4ff;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .prose h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #1f2937;
    margin-top: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .prose p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .prose a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .prose a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .prose ul {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }
  .prose ul li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4b5563;
  }
  
  /* TOC Sidebar Styles */
  .toc-sidebar {
    width: 280px !important;
    flex-shrink: 0 !important;
    position: sticky !important;
    top: 100px !important;
  }
  .toc-container {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }
  .toc-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .toc-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .toc-link {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1.4;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    padding-left: 10px;
    margin-left: 2px;
  }
  .toc-link:hover, .toc-link.active {
    color: var(--blue) !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-left-color: var(--blue) !important;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .knowledge-layout {
      flex-direction: column !important;
    }
    .toc-sidebar {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .article-content {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .document-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const content = document.querySelector('.article-content');
    const tocList = document.getElementById('toc-list');
    if (!content || !tocList) return;

    const headings = content.querySelectorAll('h2');
    
    headings.forEach((heading) => {
      if(!heading.id) return;
      const li = document.createElement('li');
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = '#' + heading.id;
      a.textContent = heading.textContent;
      a.className = 'toc-link';
      li.appendChild(a);
      tocList.appendChild(li);
    });

    const observerOptions = {
      root: null,
      rootMargin: '-100px 0px -60% 0px',
      threshold: 0
    };

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          const id = entry.target.getAttribute('id');
          document.querySelectorAll('.toc-link').forEach(link => {
            link.classList.remove('active');
            if (link.getAttribute('href') === '#' + id) {
              link.classList.add('active');
            }
          });
        }
      });
    }, observerOptions);

    headings.forEach(heading => observer.observe(heading));
  });
</script>
